sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant UI as JobsPage / Redux
  participant API as jobService / Express
  participant Job as jobController
  participant DB as MongoDB
  User->>UI: filter and browse opportunities
  UI->>API: GET /api/jobs with filters/cursor
  API->>Job: protect then getJobs
  Job->>DB: query jobs
  DB-->>UI: page and cursor
  User->>UI: apply with resume/documents
  UI->>API: POST /api/jobs/:id/apply multipart
  API->>Job: Multer fields + applyToJob
  Job->>DB: append embedded application
  DB-->>UI: application result
  User->>UI: update application status
  UI->>API: PUT /:id/application/:applicationId/status
  API->>DB: authorize/update application status
